shifting.pro
===============

shifting.pro is an independent, open-source educational browser game that
teaches Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform administration and helps prepare
for the Red Hat Certified Specialist in OpenShift Administration exam (EX280).

This project is a derivative work of "K8s Games" (originally a Kubernetes
learning game), available at:

    https://github.com/rohitg00/k8sgames

K8s Games was authored by Rohit G (GitHub: rohitg00) and is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The original project's license text is retained in
the LICENSE file of this repository. This derivative work has been substantially
modified and rebranded for OpenShift/EX280 education by Gustaf Ekfeldt
(GitHub: G-man3207) in 2026.

Modifications include, but are not limited to: complete rebranding; conversion
of Kubernetes content, resources, commands and curriculum to Red Hat OpenShift
Container Platform 4.22 concepts (projects, Routes, BuildConfigs, ImageStreams,
templates, SCCs, quotas, HTPasswd/OAuth identity, Operators, Kustomize/Helm, and
oc CLI workflows); a rewritten EX280-aligned campaign, incidents, challenges and
an in-app EX280 Prep mode; and new 3D resource representations and drawing
support for OpenShift resources.

